    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_317 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∃ c > 0, ∀ n ≥ 1, ∃ δ : Fin n → ℚ,\n      Set.range δ ⊆ {-1, 0, 1} ∧\n      letI lhs : ℝ := |∑ k, (δ k) / (k + 1)|\n      0 < lhs ∧ lhs < c / 2^n",
